WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:31.160
[Yamato yells]

3
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.450
<b>My Bible</b>

4
00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.340
[PAGE ONE]
Don't just stand around!

5
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.260
Hurry up and go fetch
the medical team, now!

6
00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.550
[BEAST PIRATE E]
Move it!

7
00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.640
[PAGE ONE]
Don't lose sight of those two.

8
00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.060
Slow 'em down and
report their location to us!

9
00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.940
[PAGE ONE]
Damn Yamato!

10
00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:01.070
[BEAST PIRATE E]
Are you sure
you're all right, sir?

11
00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:03.320
You took a pretty
major beating yourself!

12
00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.730
[Page One groans]

13
00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:07.820
[PAGE ONE]
Fair point.
He did clock me pretty good.

14
00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:09.400
My jaw feels a little loose.

15
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.820
[BEAST PIRATE E]
That's all that hurts?

16
00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.200
[PAGE ONE]
Where the hell are the medics?

17
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.780
This is an emergency!

18
00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:16.040
[BEAST PIRATE G]
Sorry for the wait, sir!

19
00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:27.270
[gasps]

20
00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:29.360
[ULTI]
That light is super annoying!

21
00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.230
[Beast Pirates groan]

22
00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.980
[Page One sighs]

23
00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.280
[ULTI]
Pay-Pay!

24
00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:35.690
[Ulticries]

25
00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.610
[PAGE ONE]
Hm?

26
00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:42.620
[ULTI]
Pray for me! I got
a life-threatening boo-boo!

27
00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.540
[PAGE ONE]
If you're in pain,
lie back down!

28
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.250
[ULTI]
What's with the attitude?

29
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.460
Shouldn't you be happy
I'm not dead?

30
00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:54.660
[Page One groans]

31
00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.910
[ULTI]
I'll get that nasty Yamato!

32
00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.290
How dare that bastard
use Commander Kaido's

33
00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.250
Thunder Bagua on me!

34
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.790
[PAGE ONE]
Ah, guess she's fine.

35
00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:06.880
[ULTI]
More like,
Blunder Bad-ua, am I right?

36
00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.950
[Ulti groans]

37
00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.490
[ULTI]
Not like it hurt anyway.

38
00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.070
[PAGE ONE]
C'mon, Sis.

39
00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.700
Sorry to interrupt!

40
00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.500
Both the enemies are currently
stopped in the hall, Sir!

41
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.870
[PAGE ONE]
Perfect!

42
00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:24.780
[ULTI]
Hey, Pay-Pay!
Aren't you forgetting someone?

43
00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.410
Where are you taking me?

44
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.420
If you got something to say,
just tell me here!

45
00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.500
[YAMATO]
Don't be hasty.

46
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.090
I promise you this
will not take long.

47
00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:44.220
[LUFFY]
Get out of my way!

48
00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.470
[grunts]

49
00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.650
[YAMATO]
Please, just hear me out!

50
00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.120
[Luffy grunts]

51
00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.330
Just say it already!

52
00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.210
[groans]

53
00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.510
[YAMATO]
There are people listening.

54
00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.930
We must go somewhere private.

55
00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.800
I said no!

56
00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:07.170
[YAMATO]
Impressive.

57
00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.100
[YAMATO]
Impressive. You remind
me of someone I once fought.

58
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:11.060
You remind me of someone
I once fought.

59
00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:19.220
[Beast Pirates groaning]

60
00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.640
Dammit all! They're gone!

61
00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.640
[Luffy coughing]

62
00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.850
[PAGE ONE]
What's going on? Where's Yamato?

63
00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:28.320
I'm sorry, sir! But we lost
sight of the both of them!

64
00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:29.570
them!

65
00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:34.440
<b>Performance

Floor



Skull Dome</b>

66
00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:39.070
Surely you all rember
when Kozuki Oden died, yes?

67
00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.980
It was the very same
day that Oden Castle

68
00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.360
went down in a sea of flames!

69
00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:47.640
You know, there is a mystery
lingering from back then!

70
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.720
A group of people
disappeared into thin air!

71
00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:55.020
This little brat and his
Akazaya samurai lackeys!

72
00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:02.070
And where did
those fugitives go? Huh?

73
00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:04.110
To the future!

74
00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.570
To be precise, they traveled
exactly 20 years through time!

75
00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.120
Do you get it?

76
00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.120
That's why they're here
in the Land of Wano

77
00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.080
looking the same age
as they did back then!

78
00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.340
[all gasp]

79
00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.760
And who was responsible
for this dangerous magic?

80
00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.970
A treacherous witch.

81
00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:25.220
Oden's wretched wife,
Kozuki Toki!

82
00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.670
She thought she could
send them here to kill me,

83
00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:31.710
but now, I have her son.

84
00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.380
[Beast Pirate B laughs]
Good one, Shogun!

85
00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.640
[Beast Pirate F]
The kid with
the topknot's a nice touch!

86
00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.470
You almost had me
for a second there!

87
00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:47.060
[laughs]
We all know that the
Kozuki family died out ages ago!

88
00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.190
Ain't that right,
brother? [laughs]

89
00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.980
[Jinbe laughs]
Damn straight, man!

90
00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.030
Some real funny stuff!

91
00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.030
[laughs]

92
00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.490
[ROBIN]
Hey, hey, Shogun Orochi!

93
00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:02.280
Why don't you come
down here with us, bro?

94
00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.080
There's no need for you
to get your hands dirty!

95
00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.580
Lemme at him, and I'll
gouge his friggin' eyes out!

96
00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:08.470
[all laugh]

97
00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:11.010
How dare you call
my mother a witch!

98
00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.420
I shall personally
make you pay for that!

99
00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:14.840
[OROCHI]
You dare to challenge
me, you insolent little louse?

100
00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.090
What?

101
00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.540
I wonder how I should kill you.

102
00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.210
A stabbing? A shooting?

103
00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.300
Or perhaps I should
boil you alive?!

104
00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.050
[Beast Pirate F laughs]

105
00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.390
Do you have any
suggestions, Boss?

106
00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.770
We have to do something.
They'll kill him!

107
00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.440
We must maintain
our trust in the samurai.

108
00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.860
It's a delicate situation.
Be patient.

109
00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.150
[both laughing]

110
00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.150
[laughing]

111
00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.940
[KAKUNOSHIN]
Lord Momonosuke!

112
00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.650
[SAMURAI D]
Stay strong!

113
00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.240
[Jinbe laughs]

114
00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.610
[TABUHACHIRO]
How awful.

115
00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.700
[HYOGORO]
We're so close.

116
00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.990
[NARRATOR]
The samurai gaze on helplessly

117
00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.410
as Momonosuke suffers,

118
00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.460
but maintain their secrecy,

119
00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:56.000
blending in seamlessly
at the celebration.

120
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.120
[Beast Pirates laughing]

121
00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.450
<b>Law</b>

122
00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.790
[NARRATOR]
Meanwhile, Law's
submarine, the Polar Tang,

123
00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:06.040
<b>Law</b>

124
00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.500
reaches its destination,
delivering his crew

125
00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.960
and several samurai
to the rear of Onigashima.

126
00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:04.920
<b>LawLaw</b>

127
00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:06.960
<b>Law</b>

128
00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.110
- [crash]
- [gasps]

129
00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.110
[all gasp]

130
00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.530
Adjust trim by 38 degrees!

131
00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.120
I'm on it! Brace yourselves!

132
00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.620
Get us as close to
the island as you can.

133
00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:19.830
[HEART PIRATE B]
Yes, sir!

134
00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.920
This is a tricky spot.

135
00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.750
We don't want to get mixed up
in all those currents.

136
00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:40.470
[all gasp]

137
00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.310
It's just as bad as above.

138
00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.940
Once we surface,
we'll only have one shot.

139
00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.400
I understand!

140
00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.440
We're counting on you,
Traffy! Get us there!

141
00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.940
Bepo! Shachi! Penguin!

142
00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.360
Is everyone ready?

143
00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.320
Aye, aye, Captain!

144
00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.990
[PENGUIN, SHACHI]
– Aye-aye, sir!
– Aye-aye, sir!

145
00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:01.080
Take us to Kaido! Away we go!

146
00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.870
[SHACHI]
All systems clear!

147
00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.170
We're ready to
surface at any time!

148
00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.580
Okay!

149
00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.670
On my call.

150
00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:09.920
Now!

151
00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:37.160
[DOGSTORM]
It's snowing.

152
00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.450
Go, Room!

153
00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.760
And Shambles!

154
00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.550
They're gone now!

155
00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:02.300
Let's pull the doors closed!

156
00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.180
Time to resubmerge!

157
00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.890
[HEART PIRATE C]
Roger! Ready for rapid descent!

158
00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:16.440
Well, friends. We've made it.

159
00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.820
[Law sighs]

160
00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:21.320
Your ability is quite
extraordinary, Sir Law!

161
00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.510
There are two entrances.

162
00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.140
We can expect to
see Kaido up top.

163
00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:32.230
[CAT VIPER]
Hey! Why do you-gara
always have to be so mean, huh?

164
00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.230
[MARCO]
I'm just saying,
you got us into this mess

165
00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.190
in the first place.

166
00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.530
[CAT VIPER]
Hey, wait!

167
00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.900
[Cat Viper yelps]

168
00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.490
I know that yelp.

169
00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:45.070
[Cat Viper yells]

170
00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.120
[all gasp]

171
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:57.040
[Cat Viper groans]

172
00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.050
You-gara could have
warned me about the drop.

173
00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.760
Why, it's Cat Viper!

174
00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.510
Look at you!
You've gotten so much bigger!

175
00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.800
Huh? You're alive!

176
00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.470
Kawamatsu! Huh?

177
00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:12.230
Ashura! Is that really you-gara?

178
00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.730
Indeed, it is! Been a while!

179
00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.150
[Marco sighs]
Here we go!

180
00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.440
[DOGSTORM]
Marco!
Did you-gara carry him here?

181
00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.150
[MARCO]
Mm-hmm! And I'm beat!

182
00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.950
Carrying two people
ain't easy, you know!

183
00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.530
There's two?

184
00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:27.660
What?

185
00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.200
Wait.

186
00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.410
[gasps]

187
00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:37.790
[Both gasp]

188
00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.690
It's really you.

189
00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.240
Big Brother!

190
00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:14.500
[Okiku crying]

191
00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.920
Kiku. What a fine samurai
you've become.

192
00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.370
[BOTH]
– Izo!
– Izo!

193
00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.170
And just in time to aid us!

194
00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.670
I thought you might
never return to Wano!

195
00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:28.010
Right! Sorry I didn't
mention Izo earlier!

196
00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.180
Marco said he knew
where to find him,

197
00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.800
so I went to go pick him up!

198
00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.430
Figured we could use him!

199
00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.520
[DOGSTORM]
Greetings!

200
00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.560
You-gara haven't
changed one bit!

201
00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.940
You're too kind.

202
00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.560
We'll have time catch up
on the good old days later.

203
00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.940
There was a strange shadow
that I spotted on the way here.

204
00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:47.240
I'd like to go and check it out.

205
00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.780
It's great to see
you-gara! Be safe!

206
00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.000
I'm glad I survived
long enough to see this day.

207
00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:06.460
[SHUTENMARU]
Kaido's reign will end tonight!

208
00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:10.480
Where the hell is Linlin,
is she ready to go yet?

209
00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:11.860
[BAO HUANG]
Actually, she is!

210
00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.150
Big Mom is dressed and
already on her way, sir!

211
00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:15.860
[sighs]

212
00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:18.660
You should have told me that
as soon as you got here!

213
00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:22.740
[Bao Huang chuckles]
Whoopsies!

214
00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.870
[KAIDO]
Let's hurry!

215
00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.460
Momonosuke's execution
will be the perfect place

216
00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.290
for my official announcement.

217
00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.920
Time to go.

218
00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:38.840
[Orochi cackles]

219
00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:45.340
Now. Let's raise a toast
to the death of the Kozuki!

220
00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.260
[Queen gasps]

221
00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.790
Commander Kaido?

222
00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.080
Man of the hour's here!
Time to party!

223
00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:14.790
[Beast Pirates cheering]

224
00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.230
[Both gasp]

225
00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.610
[KAIDO]
All right!

226
00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.700
Listen up, everyone!

227
00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.780
This execution is
depressing as hell,

228
00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.120
so I'm gonna liven things up!

229
00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:34.040
It's time for the
New Onigashima Project!

230
00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.790
[Beast Pirates cheer]

231
00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:53.370
<b>Castle

Attic</b>

232
00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:53.120
[mice squeaking]

233
00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:56.790
[YAMATO]
Huh?

234
00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.840
[LUFFY]
Y'got five minutes!

235
00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:06.180
[YAMATO]
I thank you. When I
was young, I told my father:

236
00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.470
"I want to become Kozuki Oden!"

237
00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.310
Huh?

238
00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.440
[YAMATO]
He clobbered me good after that.

239
00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.150
I don't see why I gotta hear
your life's story right now.

240
00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.690
Come on, get to the point!

241
00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.590
[Beast Pirates cheer]

242
00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:22.360
[YAMATO]
I was there 20 years
ago at Oden's execution.

243
00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:26.680
I saw the "Hour of Legends"
with my own eyes.

244
00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:29.860
The world will never see
a greater samurai!

245
00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:34.070
And my father and Orochi
are the ones who slayed him!

246
00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.460
I can never forgive him!

247
00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.630
I was disgusted, of course.

248
00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.090
But I was moved, as well!

249
00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:45.880
As I cried, I felt
a rumbling in my soul!

250
00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:50.060
[YAMATO]
And then, one day,
I happened upon something

251
00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.770
while I was in Kuri.

252
00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.820
[YAMATO]
It was Kozuki Oden's logbook.

253
00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.890
"Oden's Travel Record"

254
00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.660
Whoa! His journal?

255
00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.950
[YAMATO]
Yes. I live by these passages!

256
00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:09.210
My father and his crew
don't know this item exists.

257
00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:12.920
Oden's grand adventures and
everything important to him

258
00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.270
are inscribed upon
these very pages!

259
00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:15.370
[YAMATO]
Now that the
Akazaya samurai are dead,

260
00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.900
Now that the Akazaya
samurai are dead,

261
00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:21.330
someone must
carry on Oden's will!

262
00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.780
[YAMATO]
That's why...

263
00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.580
[YAMATO]
...I will open
this country to the world!

264
00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.360
[gasps]

265
00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.470
Wait a sec.

266
00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:55.800
[gasps]

267
00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.840
Please, allow me to
fight alongside you.

268
00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:03.560
Pretty sure you told me you
were Kaido's son a second ago.

269
00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:07.270
Pretty sure you told me you were
Kaido's son a second ago.

270
00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.390
[YAMATO]
Kozuki Oden
was a man, wasn't he?

271
00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.190
So I chose to become a man, too!

272
00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:15.360
[YAMATO]
I can tell you're strong.

273
00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.150
I can tell you're strong.

274
00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.860
Even when you fought me,

275
00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:21.570
it was clear you were
holding back quite a bit.

276
00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:28.290
[gasps]

277
00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.800
You really remind me of Ace.

278
00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:38.100
[gasps]

279
00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:44.330
<b>Kaido's Daughter</b>

280
00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.370
<b>(Self-Proclaimed Kozuki Oden)</b>

281
00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:44.450
<b>Yam</b>

282
00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:44.370
<b>Ya</b>

283
00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:44.410
<b>Y a Kaido's Daughter m</b>

284
00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:44.630
<b>ato</b>

285
00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:44.540
<b>Yama</b>

286
00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.670
<b>Yamato</b>

287
00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.850
<b>Rear

Entrance</b>

288
00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:14.020
I knew you would
show up sooner or later.

289
00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:15.940
Although I was a bit concerned,

290
00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.190
since we failed to find any
indication that you'd snuck in.

291
00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:22.820
Fortunately for us, it seems
you just got lost on the way.

292
00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:23.900
[Beast Pirates cackle]

293
00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.320
But even if you're foolish,

294
00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.330
I know quite well
how persistent you are!

295
00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:29.540
[Gifter A laughs]
They're here!

296
00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.830
You really called it!

297
00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.960
They've been hiding away
like scared little rats

298
00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.420
ever since the
boiling went down!

299
00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.320
[IZO]
Kanjuro. You traitor!

300
00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.950
The raid will not be
happening today.

301
00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:46.120
Oh, wait. Is that Izo?

302
00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.790
You're back just in time to die!

303
00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:54.670
You made samurai warriors
with their heads removed.

304
00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.220
How very artful.

305
00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:59.050
I even tried to make them
look just like you.

306
00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:02.180
It's surprising you've lasted
this long without Oden.

307
00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.300
You're powerless
without him to lead you!

308
00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.840
How quickly you forget
we still have a leader!

309
00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:10.100
Lord Momonosuke will show us
the path to the future!

310
00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:13.180
Where did you take him?
He had better be safe!

311
00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.600
[all gasp]

312
00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.700
[laughs]
Even I
cannot say for sure.

313
00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.590
He's with Orochi now.

314
00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:22.220
The boy did try to
escape as best he could.

315
00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:27.510
These accursed tunnels
will be the death of me!

316
00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.180
[Kanjuro groans]

317
00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.230
[Kanjuro gasps]
Get back here!

318
00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.700
[Kanjuro growls]

319
00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.580
[MOMONOSUKE]
I refuse to be a burden anymore!

320
00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.620
This all ends here!

321
00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.250
[groans]

322
00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.610
[grunts]

323
00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:28.120
[Kanjuro grunting]

324
00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.450
I can't have you getting away.

325
00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.830
[KANJURO]
If you do, I'll be
unable to fulfill my role!

326
00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.750
[Kanjuro grunting]

327
00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.670
I had intended to
knock him unconscious cleanly,

328
00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:46.090
but I'm afraid that I must have
overdone it a little bit.

329
00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.060
Thankfully, he has
some fighting spirit

330
00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.680
and was able to cling to life.

331
00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.350
Imagine if I'd given the
shogun his lifeless body!

332
00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.400
[OKIKU]
Lord Momonosuke!

333
00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:00.120
As we speak, the shogun
is graciously ensuring

334
00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.670
that Momonosuke's execution
will be a big hit!

335
00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:07.220
[laughs]
All I have to do
is buy them a little time,

336
00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.720
and it all ends here!

337
00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.430
The tale of the Kozuki Clan

338
00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.010
will officially be
nothing but history!

339
00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:15.310
Out of the way, you bastard!

340
00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.100
[Dgostorm grunts]

341
00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.270
[Gifter B groans]

342
00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:00.520
Hold on a second!
What happened to your leg?

343
00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:03.980
You-gara like it?
Two-Sword Style.

344
00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.230
That's fancy!

345
00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:06.480
[Beast Pirate C groans]

346
00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:07.990
Cool, ain't it?

347
00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:09.700
I'm looking forward
to usin' this bad boy

348
00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.700
to plug Kaido full of holes!

349
00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.000
How impressive!

350
00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:17.980
[cackling]

351
00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:21.280
Huh? Something the matter, Kiku?

352
00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:24.530
Let it out!
There's no need to hold back!

353
00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:30.160
Go on. Go on. Go on!

354
00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.500
[KANJURO]
Hm?

355
00:22:36.340 --> 00:22:38.710
Never speak to me
again, Kanjuro.

356
00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.590
I have heard enough.

357
00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:47.720
[OKIKU]
Evening Shower Kanjuro
shall be rembered as a friend.

358
00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:51.480
But he will exist
only in memory.

359
00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:56.020
[OKIKU]
Prepare thyself.

360
00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:58.730
The wounds this katana
sears upon thy flesh

361
00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:01.490
persist even into the afterlife.

362
00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:07.820
<b>Kikunojo of the Lingering Snow
A Retainer of the Kozuki Clan</b>

363
00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:04.070
Like snow that lingers
in the spring,

364
00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:07.370
it will torment thy soul
for all eternity!

365
00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:12.790
Splendidly

366
00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:17.540
[Okiku yells]

367
00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:25.600
[Beast Pirates chattering]

368
00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.500
[BEAST PIRATE D]
Hey! Why aren't
the Video Transponder Snails on?

369
00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:33.380
[BEAST PIRATE E]
The commander's
speech has already started!

370
00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:37.860
I, Kozuki Oden,
have heard much about you.

371
00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:39.870
Now, listen well,
brother of Ace.

372
00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:42.290
I desire to board
your pirate ship.

373
00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.660
Do you accept?

374
00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:44.910
Oh, boy.

375
00:23:44.910 --> 00:23:47.330
Do you even know how crazy
you sound right now?

376
00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:50.800
Just saying "I'm Kozuki Oden"
doesn't make it true.

377
00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:53.590
Fine! You're more Oden
than me! Happy?

378
00:23:53.590 --> 00:23:56.680
More Oden? What the heck
does that even mean?

379
00:23:57.510 --> 00:24:00.600
You're free to see the world,
just like he was.

380
00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:04.560
[sighs]
I just wish I had
that same freedom.

381
00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:11.150
I wanted to travel with Ace
more than anything in the world.

382
00:24:13.070 --> 00:24:14.740
Unfortunately,
I've been imprisoned

383
00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:14.950
on this accursed island
since I was eight years old.

384
00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:15.490
on!

385
00:24:15.490 --> 00:24:17.420
It was when I was 8 years old

386
00:24:17.980 --> 00:24:21.770
Huh? Is that what
those cuffs are about?

387
00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:23.020
That's correct.

388
00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:25.110
And my father told me
that they would explode

389
00:24:25.110 --> 00:24:27.480
if I left the confines
of this island.

390
00:24:27.480 --> 00:24:29.110
But to be quite honest, I'm not
sure if he's lying or not.

391
00:24:31.250 --> 00:24:34.710
I mean, what kind of parent
would blow up their own child?

392
00:24:34.710 --> 00:24:37.510
And yet I am stuck here,
living in fear.

393
00:24:37.510 --> 00:24:39.260
What if it is true?

394
00:24:39.260 --> 00:24:41.390
Would my father
really be that cruel?

395
00:24:41.390 --> 00:24:43.760
I can take 'em off. Want me to?

396
00:24:44.100 --> 00:24:45.350
[Yamato gasps]
You can?

397
00:24:45.350 --> 00:24:48.180
Listen. Do you really
wanna team up with us

398
00:24:48.180 --> 00:24:49.810
and fight on our side?

399
00:24:49.810 --> 00:24:51.940
You know, joing us
means you'd have to

400
00:24:51.940 --> 00:24:53.860
watch me kick your dad's ass!

401
00:24:53.860 --> 00:24:55.900
I would do it myself if I could!

402
00:24:55.900 --> 00:24:57.650
Do you know how
many times that man

403
00:24:57.650 --> 00:25:00.620
has raised a hand to me
since I was a child?

404
00:25:00.620 --> 00:25:03.660
Whenever I challenged him,
he made sure I paid!

405
00:25:03.660 --> 00:25:06.290
Cool. Come here and
I'll get rid of 'em.

406
00:25:06.290 --> 00:25:08.160
[YAMATO]
It's not that simple!

407
00:25:08.160 --> 00:25:10.790
These have kept me
trapped here for 20 years!

408
00:25:10.790 --> 00:25:12.880
They aren't ordinary
handcuffs, you know!

409
00:25:12.880 --> 00:25:14.300
[KAIDO]
It's been two years since

410
00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:17.000
the Navy's war
against Whitebeard.

411
00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:21.340
[Beast Pirate cheer]

412
00:25:21.340 --> 00:25:22.970
[BEAST PIRATE G]
Woo! They're projecting

413
00:25:22.970 --> 00:25:24.890
the big speech for us!

414
00:25:24.890 --> 00:25:26.600
[Beast Pirates chattering]

415
00:25:27.430 --> 00:25:30.350
[KAIDO]
And now, finally,
the world has started to change!

416
00:25:30.350 --> 00:25:32.860
The Seven Warlords
system was abolished.

417
00:25:32.860 --> 00:25:36.190
But not by coincidence,
or some foolish whim.

418
00:25:40.860 --> 00:25:43.620
The Navy must have a new
force they're confident in!

419
00:25:43.620 --> 00:25:45.280
They think they have
the strength to bring

420
00:25:45.280 --> 00:25:48.200
an Emperor of the Sea
under their control!

421
00:25:51.420 --> 00:25:52.960
[KAIDO]
Nonsense!

422
00:25:52.960 --> 00:25:57.040
But their arrogance has
afforded us a great opportunity.

423
00:25:57.040 --> 00:25:59.340
We shall acquire
the Ancient Weapons,

424
00:25:59.340 --> 00:26:02.930
and become the strongest
force in the world!

425
00:26:02.930 --> 00:26:08.350
[Beast Pirates cheering]

426
00:26:03.720 --> 00:26:08.470
[Nami groans]

427
00:26:05.890 --> 00:26:08.470
[Homies chuckling]

428
00:26:08.470 --> 00:26:11.140
The first step begins right now!

429
00:26:15.820 --> 00:26:19.360
[Beast Pirate gasp]

430
00:26:17.980 --> 00:26:19.360
[groans]

431
00:26:19.360 --> 00:26:23.240
[KAIDO]
Meet our new ally, Big Mom!

432
00:26:24.770 --> 00:26:28.940
[Beast Pirates scream]

433
00:26:38.030 --> 00:26:40.950
My apologies for the wait.

434
00:26:40.330 --> 00:26:46.670
<b>Olin the Oiran
Captain of the Big Mom Pirates
Bounty: 4 Billion 388 Million Berries</b>

435
00:26:40.950 --> 00:26:44.410
I heard my name. Hello, Kaido!

436
00:26:47.790 --> 00:26:49.750
[Big Mom chuckles]

437
00:26:48.200 --> 00:26:52.240
[laughs]

438
00:26:53.530 --> 00:26:55.240
Unbelievable.

439
00:26:55.540 --> 00:26:56.950
It had to be Big Mom.

440
00:26:58.780 --> 00:27:01.670
[laughs]
Good to
have you back, Zeus.

441
00:27:01.670 --> 00:27:03.290
Did you miss me?

442
00:27:03.290 --> 00:27:05.670
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why, of course
I missed you, Mama!

443
00:27:05.670 --> 00:27:06.710
Why wouldn't I?

444
00:27:06.710 --> 00:27:08.840
[laughs]
That's my boy!

445
00:27:08.840 --> 00:27:10.340
[cackles]

446
00:27:10.340 --> 00:27:12.220
[BEAST PIRATE E]
So that's
the world's most powerful hag?

447
00:27:12.220 --> 00:27:15.100
Damn! She's scary
as hell up close!

448
00:27:17.310 --> 00:27:20.560
[both groan]

449
00:27:20.560 --> 00:27:22.600
Try to run, Zeus!

450
00:27:22.980 --> 00:27:24.020
[gasps]
Nami?

451
00:27:24.020 --> 00:27:27.320
She's gotten ahold
of our allies!

452
00:27:27.320 --> 00:27:30.610
[KAIDO]
So there you are! About time!

453
00:27:30.610 --> 00:27:33.360
The hell took you
so long, Linlin?

454
00:27:33.360 --> 00:27:35.870
Well, I am right
here now, aren't I?

455
00:27:35.870 --> 00:27:38.870
Loosen up. Don't be
a stick in the mud!

456
00:27:38.870 --> 00:27:44.420
[chuckles]

457
00:27:44.420 --> 00:27:47.000
Today's a momentous occasion!

458
00:27:47.000 --> 00:27:49.670
Kaido and I have
big aspirations,

459
00:27:49.670 --> 00:27:52.090
so we formed this alliance!

460
00:27:52.430 --> 00:27:53.840
What's their plan?

461
00:27:53.840 --> 00:27:55.970
We will have to put
our differences aside

462
00:27:55.970 --> 00:27:57.140
to make this work.

463
00:27:57.140 --> 00:27:58.430
But if we join sides,

464
00:27:58.430 --> 00:28:00.720
then we can make
the impossible possible!

465
00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:02.940
Now, listen up, everybody!

466
00:28:02.940 --> 00:28:06.770
We're gonna show the world
what pirating's really about!

467
00:28:06.770 --> 00:28:09.070
Hold on to your seats!

468
00:28:09.070 --> 00:28:11.900
[KAIDO]
We're going on a treasure hunt.

469
00:28:14.240 --> 00:28:17.740
[BOTH]
Together, we're going
to find the One Piece!

470
00:28:19.700 --> 00:28:24.170
[Beast Pirates cheer]

471
00:28:24.170 --> 00:28:25.460
No way.

472
00:28:25.830 --> 00:28:28.840
One Piece? Did they say
the One Piece?

473
00:28:28.840 --> 00:28:31.630
That's my thing, bastards!

474
00:28:32.670 --> 00:28:35.590
People are controlled
by fear and strength.

475
00:28:35.590 --> 00:28:37.390
That's why the
Ancient Weapons will be

476
00:28:37.390 --> 00:28:40.140
an essential part
of our operation.

477
00:28:40.600 --> 00:28:44.190
Now, I ask you. Are you ready?

478
00:28:44.190 --> 00:28:45.940
This is the world we seek!

479
00:28:45.940 --> 00:28:48.110
One that's brimming
with violence!

480
00:28:48.110 --> 00:28:53.640
[Beast Pirates cheer]

481
00:28:53.140 --> 00:28:54.850
[chuckles]

482
00:28:54.850 --> 00:28:56.430
Remarkable!

483
00:28:58.230 --> 00:28:59.600
Listen, followers of Orochi.

484
00:28:59.600 --> 00:29:02.770
You have an important
choice to make.

485
00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:06.860
A choice that will
determine your futures.

486
00:29:06.860 --> 00:29:08.700
[gasps]

487
00:29:08.700 --> 00:29:10.620
What is he talking about?

488
00:29:11.440 --> 00:29:13.610
Look at your country.

489
00:29:13.950 --> 00:29:15.660
The waterfalls
that surround Wano

490
00:29:15.660 --> 00:29:18.030
make this land
a natural fortress.

491
00:29:18.030 --> 00:29:19.200
One even the Navy

492
00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:21.620
and the World Government
can't penetrate.

493
00:29:21.910 --> 00:29:25.040
If we build more weapon
factories within our borders,

494
00:29:26.580 --> 00:29:29.920
and force the people of the
Flower Capital to work in them,

495
00:29:29.920 --> 00:29:33.630
we could transform Wano
into a lawless land!

496
00:29:33.630 --> 00:29:36.300
A pirate paradise!

497
00:29:39.010 --> 00:29:41.390
[chuckles]

498
00:29:41.390 --> 00:29:45.720
How dare you? How dare you?!

499
00:29:46.810 --> 00:29:47.360
You drunk bastard!

500
00:29:47.360 --> 00:29:48.180
You heard what

501
00:29:48.180 --> 00:29:50.120
What is the meaning
of this madness?

502
00:29:50.120 --> 00:29:52.450
The Flower Capital
is my territory,

503
00:29:52.450 --> 00:29:54.540
do you understand me?

504
00:29:56.010 --> 00:29:57.720
[growls]

505
00:29:57.720 --> 00:30:00.600
Look at me! Kaido!

506
00:30:01.310 --> 00:30:04.520
Perhaps I should hurry and
slaughter this little urchin,

507
00:30:04.520 --> 00:30:07.560
so you all show me
the reverence I deserve!

508
00:30:07.560 --> 00:30:10.020
Even the Kozuki Clan
will fall into line

509
00:30:10.020 --> 00:30:12.690
once I parade his corpse
in front of them!

510
00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:15.110
I want them to feel the pain

511
00:30:15.110 --> 00:30:18.320
the Kurozumi Clan has
carried for so long!

512
00:30:18.320 --> 00:30:22.030
If anyone is destroying
the Land of Wano, it'll be me!

513
00:30:22.030 --> 00:30:24.620
I've already claimed it!

514
00:30:24.620 --> 00:30:28.420
Do I make myself clear? Kaido!

515
00:30:28.710 --> 00:30:31.580
I graciously allowed
you to be a guest here!

516
00:30:31.580 --> 00:30:33.300
Don't forget I'm
the reason why you were

517
00:30:33.300 --> 00:30:36.380
able to procure all
those weapons, damn it!

518
00:30:36.630 --> 00:30:39.260
You need to realize that
there is no Land of Wano

519
00:30:39.260 --> 00:30:42.100
without me, the Shogun!

520
00:30:43.810 --> 00:30:46.720
[sighs]

521
00:30:46.720 --> 00:30:49.270
Glad you see it my way.

522
00:30:49.270 --> 00:30:51.060
So let's stop stalling!

523
00:30:51.060 --> 00:30:54.570
Take your sword and chop off
that miserable brat's...

524
00:30:57.490 --> 00:30:59.120
[gasps]

525
00:31:09.800 --> 00:31:12.920
Damn nuisance.
We don't need him.

526
00:31:12.920 --> 00:31:14.640
It's done.

527
00:31:22.180 --> 00:31:29.190
[laughing]

528
00:31:35.920 --> 00:31:37.960
He had it coming.

529
00:31:41.880 --> 00:31:44.050
Now let me be clear.

530
00:31:45.300 --> 00:31:48.600
[Ksido grunts]

531
00:31:48.600 --> 00:31:53.020
[KAIDO]
The concerns of
the Kurozumi mean nothing!

532
00:31:56.190 --> 00:31:59.190
That goes for the Kozuki, too!

533
00:32:03.980 --> 00:32:10.320
[screams]

534
00:32:04.810 --> 00:32:11.320
[all laughing]

535
00:32:11.320 --> 00:32:14.610
Momo! That's him on the stage!

536
00:32:14.610 --> 00:32:16.030
– Huh?
– I'm coming.

537
00:32:16.030 --> 00:32:17.200
Hang in there!

538
00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:19.530
Be quiet! They're gonna find us!

539
00:32:19.530 --> 00:32:20.660
[Luffy, Yamato gasp]

540
00:32:20.660 --> 00:32:23.120
[Beast Pirates gasp]

541
00:32:23.410 --> 00:32:24.410
[Yamato coughs]

542
00:32:24.410 --> 00:32:25.920
[BEAST PIRATE B]
The hell was that?

543
00:32:25.920 --> 00:32:27.960
[BEAST PIRATE C]
It came from the ceiling!

544
00:32:28.940 --> 00:32:32.200
Your parasite lord is dead,
followers of Orochi.

545
00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:35.040
Now, you have five seconds.

546
00:32:35.040 --> 00:32:37.620
Where does your loyalty stand?

547
00:32:37.620 --> 00:32:40.660
Will you choose to
die here like he did?

548
00:32:41.750 --> 00:32:44.540
[KAIDO]
Or will you
conquer the world with me?

549
00:32:45.170 --> 00:32:47.590
We have a lot of
preparations to attend to

550
00:32:47.590 --> 00:32:49.010
for the upcoming war.

551
00:32:49.010 --> 00:32:50.550
The choice is clear.

552
00:32:50.550 --> 00:32:54.550
Join my crew. My pirate empire!

553
00:32:55.850 --> 00:33:00.020
We'll need the extra manpower
for our expeditions!

554
00:33:00.020 --> 00:33:02.060
Tonight, we will
relocate our base

555
00:33:02.060 --> 00:33:04.560
from this island
to the Flower Capital!

556
00:33:04.560 --> 00:33:07.480
And your country
will be no more!

557
00:33:07.480 --> 00:33:09.230
Kaido, that rat!

558
00:33:09.230 --> 00:33:12.700
Wano will be reborn
as New Onigashima!

559
00:33:12.700 --> 00:33:17.870
And the new shogun
is my son, Yamato!

560
00:33:20.960 --> 00:33:22.420
What'd he say? Shogun?

561
00:33:24.290 --> 00:33:27.290
No way in hell!

562
00:33:34.140 --> 00:33:36.600
Don't you force that on me.

563
00:33:36.600 --> 00:33:38.680
You old piece of shit!

564
00:33:39.180 --> 00:33:41.980
Save it, okay?
We gotta help Momo!

565
00:33:41.980 --> 00:33:43.770
All right. Follow me.

566
00:33:43.770 --> 00:33:45.020
Let's go!
